---
layout: false
permalink: /emails/liste-attente-cours-annule-en.html
---
<mjml>
  <mj-head>
    <mj-attributes>
      <mj-all font-family="Arial, sans-serif" />
      <mj-text font-size="16px" line-height="1.6" color="#333333" />
    </mj-attributes>
  </mj-head>
  <mj-body background-color="#f5f5f5">
    <mj-section background-color="#648ED8" padding="20px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text align="center" color="#ffffff" font-size="24px" font-weight="bold">
          The class will not take place
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-section background-color="#ffffff" padding="20px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text>
          Hello {{firstName}},
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text>
          You were on the waiting list for <strong>{{courseName}}</strong> on
          <strong>{{courseDate}}</strong> at <strong>{{courseTime}}</strong>.
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text>
          I am sorry: this class <strong>will unfortunately not take place</strong>,
          as there were not enough registrations. Nothing to do on your side,
          and no session was deducted.
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text>
          I invite you to pick another slot — I look forward to seeing you at an
          upcoming class very soon:
        </mj-text>
        <mj-button
          href="{{rebookingUrl}}"
          background-color="#E6B84A"
          color="#0f172a"
          font-weight="bold"
          padding="15px 30px"
          border-radius="5px"
        >
          Choose another class
        </mj-button>
        <mj-text>
          If the button does not work, copy and paste this link into your browser:
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text>
          <a href="{{rebookingUrl}}" style="color: #648ED8; word-break: break-all;">
            {{rebookingUrl}}
          </a>
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-section background-color="#f9f9f9" padding="20px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text align="center" font-size="14px" color="#666666">
          See you very soon in class!<br><br>
          Cédric<br>
          Fluance: the movement that awakens and soothes<br>
          <a href="https://fluance.io" style="color: #648ED8;">fluance.io</a>
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
  </mj-body>
</mjml>
